== Transportation Access ==
* A 13-minute walk from the {{ill|Transit bus|en|Transit bus|qid=Q1373492|lt=Route Bus|1=Transit bus}} stop at {{ill|Oodo Bus Stop|ja|大戸停留所|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Oodo Bus Stop|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}}.

